{"id":1800,"date":"2026-04-04T17:49:43","date_gmt":"2026-04-04T09:49:43","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/?p=1800"},"modified":"2026-04-14T12:48:26","modified_gmt":"2026-04-14T04:48:26","slug":"vulcan-shield-global-advances-european-expansion-with-new-milestone-in-bekescsaba","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/vulcan-shield-global-advances-european-expansion-with-new-milestone-in-bekescsaba\/","title":{"rendered":"Vulcan Shield Global Advances European Expansion with New Milestone in B\u00e9k\u00e9scsaba"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"1800\" class=\"elementor elementor-1800\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5ef05f1 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"5ef05f1\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-36cf866 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"36cf866\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.19.0 - 28-02-2024 *\/\n.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-stacked .elementor-drop-cap{background-color:#69727d;color:#fff}.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-framed .elementor-drop-cap{color:#69727d;border:3px solid;background-color:transparent}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap{margin-top:8px}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap-letter{width:1em;height:1em}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap{float:left;text-align:center;line-height:1;font-size:50px}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap-letter{display:inline-block}<\/style>\t\t\t\t<p>Vulcan Shield Hungary has reached a significant milestone with the ceremonial foundation stone laying of its new manufacturing facility in B\u00e9k\u00e9scsaba, Hungary.<\/p><p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.4px;\">The event was attended by senior leadership from Vulcan Shield Global, alongside key government representatives including P\u00e9ter Szijj\u00e1rt\u00f3, Istv\u00e1n Jo\u00f3, Dr \u00c1rp\u00e1d Tak\u00e1cs, and P\u00e9ter Szarvas, highlighting the strategic importance of the project to Hungary\u2019s industrial development.<\/span><\/p><h3>Production Commences in Hungary<\/h3><p>In parallel with the foundation milestone, Vulcan Shield Hungary has commenced production of advanced ceramic and alumina fiber insulation materials at its temporary facility located at INPARK. This enables early-stage supply to European customers ahead of the completion of the permanent plant.<\/p><p>Since establishing operations in B\u00e9k\u00e9scsaba just seven months ago, Vulcan Shield Hungary has made rapid progress in building its manufacturing capabilities and local presence.<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.4px;\">Building a Local Industrial Ecosystem<\/span><\/p><p>As part of its long-term strategy, Vulcan Shield Hungary has actively engaged with the local ecosystem:<\/p><ul><li>A job fair attracting hundreds of applicants, supporting regional employment<\/li><li>A supplier forum connecting with approximately 60 local and regional companies<\/li><li>A university partnership with the University of Szeged, fostering research collaboration and talent development<\/li><\/ul><p>These initiatives reflect a commitment to building a sustainable and collaborative industrial base in Hungary.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1f9946a e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"1f9946a\" data-element_type=\"co