neration applications across high-performance industries. The centre will play a pivotal role in strengthening Hungary\u2019s position as a hub for advanced manufacturing, research, and innovation.<\/p><h3>Strengthening Global Supply and Innovation<\/h3><p>The development of Vulcan Shield Hungary strengthens the broader group\u2019s global manufacturing footprint, complementing existing operations and enhancing supply capabilities across regions.<\/p><p>With manufacturing presence in both Asia and Europe, the group is better positioned to support customers with improved supply chain resilience, regional accessibility, and long-term reliability.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e858491 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"e858491\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-63947ab e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"63947ab\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;full&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-38a7055 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"38a7055\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"427\" src=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/4KMS_VS_BCS-150-1024x683.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-1870\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/4KMS_VS_BCS-150-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/4KMS_VS_BCS-150-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/4KMS_VS_BCS-150-768x5